{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113413","id":3061185102,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62dfpO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113413","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113413.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113413.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113413","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113413/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113413/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113413/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/08cb31b4d169a6ba85c0acf1de4431d3c3aa0d9d","number":113413,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix screen-space AA when scaling using bilinear filtering","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes an existing issue I noticed while working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/79731. If using bilinear scaling, screen-space AA methods (and I guess anything else in the tonemapping shader) sample the internal 3D viewport texture, but render to a full-sized framebuffer, breaking the screen-space AA algorithms.\r\n\r\n**0.25x scale using bilinear filtering:**\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|:-------------------------:|:-------------------------:|\r\n|<img width=\"1364\" height=\"838\" alt=\"2025-12-01_13-42\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75106721-265c-4592-8710-7ab9c0ee6388\" />|<img width=\"1365\" height=\"838\" alt=\"2025-12-01_13-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2bff007-a9e5-4076-9d12-580ca5c00385\" />|\r\n\r\nYou can see more easily how it breaks when using nearest-neighbour filtering:\r\n**0.25x scale using nearest-neighbour filtering:**\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|:-------------------------:|:-------------------------:|\r\n|<img width=\"1366\" height=\"839\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb8afd4c-d2f8-4eca-ba38-a357155e02c7\" />|<img width=\"1368\" height=\"843\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1eac8eb-805c-4d53-a634-3ae527fb073b\" />|\r\n\r\nThis pr only covers the fix for bilinear scaling because nearest-neighbour is already functional in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/79731.\r\n\r\nI didn't make any changes to Compatibility because currently it has no screen-space AA, but if a copy is cheaper than tonemapping the full resolution then maybe it's a good idea.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68096\r\nDepends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/79731","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com